text:
Today is #WorldCancerResearchDay 🔬 — a day to celebrate the power of collaboration in cancer research. Breakthroughs in cancer wouldn’t be possible without the incredible efforts of patients, researchers, organizations, and communities around the world. 

We share a global commitment: “Cancer research needs us all.” Because when we work together, we move faster toward progress.

At Pfizer, we’re working to help people with cancer live better and longer lives. Our goal is to deliver eight cancer breakthroughs by 2030, bringing new hope and better outcomes to patients everywhere. Learn more about how we’re working to outdo cancer: https://t.co/rTk4FKfFBU

